            </note>
            <note corresp="#d36-f4" n="4" xml:id="d36-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram 7307 from London, April 1, the Embassy reported that Reagan’s message was delivered to the Prime
                    Minister’s office during the evening of April 1. (Department of State, Central
                    Foreign Policy File, D820174–0106)</p>
            </note>
